 enrollment selfsigned
 subject-name cn=IOS-Self-Signed-Certificate-2477170013
 revocation-check none
 rsakeypair TP-self-signed-2477170013
!
crypto pki trustpoint SLA-TrustPoint
 enrollment pkcs12
 revocation-check crl
